  "description": "WUSKOM crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P 1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C112 H132 Eu6 N12 O28. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu6 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.752-3.861 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.08-112.52°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Eu6C112H132N12O28. Article name explicitly identifies Eu(II), Eu(III).",
